      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The Aether NPU core voltage rails are specified at $0.85\\text{V} \\pm 0.01\\text{V}$ for the compute cluster, with auxiliary rails operating at $1.2\\text{V}$ and $1.0\\text{V}$ respectively, maintaining a ripple tolerance below $5\\%$. Clock speeds are provisioned up to $2.8\\text{GHz}$ under nominal load, scaling down to $1.5\\text{GHz}$ during low-power states, achieving a peak power efficiency of $45\\text{TOPS/W}$ at $80\\%$ utilization. Thermal tolerances mandate an operational range between $-20^\\circ\\text{C}$ and $95^\\circ\\text{C}$, with a critical shutdown threshold set at $105^\\circ\\text{C}$ to ensure component longevity exceeding $99.9\\%$ reliability.",
      "source": "target",
